<title>UK: UK meals and feeds unchanged, trade light.</title>
<headline>UK meals and feeds unchanged, trade light.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Most selling levels on the UK meals and feeds market were unchanged on Tuesday with many players sidelined ahead of the release on Wednesday of the USDA's latest crop report.</p>
<p>&quot;Buyers have been sniffing about, but hardly any of this has turned into business,&quot; said one broker</p>
<p>High protein soymeal traded at 205 stg for spot on the east coast, but there was little volume behind the trade, brokers said.</p>
<p>--Jim Ballantyne, London Newsroom, +44 171 542 8062</p>
